I propose '''merging''' to [[List of terrorist incidents linked to the Islamic State]] and [[List of terrorist incidents in Syria]] because this fails [[WP:NEVENT]], specifically [[WP:PERSISTENCE]]. It also fails [[WP:NOPAGE]], and since there isn't any scholarly or news analysis of the event itself, it is better to put it in a list. Many of the news articles that can be found, if not all, just duplicate each other to a large extent. Good lists are supposed to give information of the things they collect, so it would be more encyclopedic if they were merged. It should not be deleted since it is sourced information, which while not notable, is due for inclusion in the list pages I suggested [[User:HerrHeulsuse|HerrHeulsuse]] ([[User talk:HerrHeulsuse|talk]]) 08:02, 26 July 2026 (UTC)

